'''Sayaka Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 296
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Sayaka Cat
|name2 = Magical Girl Sayaka Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Magical Girl Sayaka Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
As an attacker, Sayaka Cat highly underperforms when compared to other Cats, like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]]. With that being said, Sayaka has high enough stats that when stacked and hypermaxed, Sayaka can be used throughout early [[Legend Stages|Stories of Legend]]. Beyond that, Magical Sayaka can contribute to your [[User Rank]], as this Cat does not have enough range to be useful anywhere else.

{{Job|Classification = Melee & User Rank Dump}}

